      "sourceTextSha256": "7dca4db5bf92ed93faceaab04636569e0e139b114d7a258f4f929b5f9228ba13",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport. Flight to Caracas and connection to Margarita Island.\n\nMeet and transfer to the all-inclusive hotel.\n\nMeals: Breakfast, dinner\n\nEnjoy a relaxing stay on the Pearl of the Caribbean — Margarita Island, famous for its pristine tropical beaches, vibrant atmosphere, and year-round sunshine.\n\nThanks to its geographical position, Margarita is the southernmost of the Caribbean resort islands.",
